# Hyæt Views Engine & PhishGuard Threat Detector

Heuristic and algorithmic threat detection suite featuring a real-time REST API, interactive web dashboard, and browser extension.

## Features
- **Live Web Engine:** Single and batch URL threat verification on Vercel.
- **Dynamic Themes:** User-selectable UI palettes (Navy Blue, Pure Black, Cyber Violet, Emerald Green).
- **Export Capabilities:** Download structured JSON analysis logs and copy text summaries.
- **Chrome Extension:** One-click active tab phishing analysis using Chrome Manifest V3.

## Live Deployment Links
- **Web Dashboard:** https://hyaet-views.vercel.app
- **REST API Endpoint:** `POST https://hyaet-views-api.onrender.com/scan`

